Key Features:
• The website is easy to use and operate, and users can complete video production in three simple steps:
• 1. Intelligent image recognition - automatically matching popular content templates and copy frameworks based on product categories and target markets;
• 2. Prompt word generation and customization - generating high-definition videos suitable for multiple languages and scenarios based on multimodal large models, and supporting fine-tuning of detail parameters;
• 3. Optimization and delivery - built-in A/B testing data dashboard and compliance review tools to help users iterate content strategies.

• Instant Kirkify AI;
• High-Quality Output;
• Batch Kirkify AI;
• Neon Border Effects;
• GIF & Video Support;
• One-Click Sharing;

• OctoComics features are as follows:
• 1. Powerful AI story script model, quickly generate various comic plots, themes, settings;
• 2. Powerful AI drawing model, good at various painting styles;
• 3. Support uploading story scripts, automatically generate storyboards and pictures;
• 4. Flexible storyboard editor, can edit canvas, layout, grid, bubble, stickers, etc.;
• 5. Professional typesetting and materials;
• 6. Comic continuation function;
• 7. Quickly create characters through NUI dialogue;
• 8. Quickly use characters through @ character name;
• 9. Massive character community resource sharing;

